  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879922",
      "title": "Adding a Couple of Base Components (Base Card, Base Button, Base Badge)",
      "lectureOrder": 243,
      "videoOrder": 215,
      "sourceHash": "c0239fd444a54a9940a8ac7ade162dfb1eed1f94ca7ac15444e7a9c2391ea477",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4.34,
          "en": "So it's base component time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.34,
          "end": 8.29,
          "en": "In the components folder, I'll add a new ui folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.29,
          "end": 10.37,
          "en": "You could also name it base,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.37,
          "end": 11.49,
          "en": "but I'll go with ui",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.49,
          "end": 14.61,
          "en": "because I have some core UI elements in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.61,
          "end": 17.8,
          "en": "And I'll add a BaseCard.vue file in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.8,
          "end": 19.333,
          "en": "and also already a BaseButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.19,
          "end": 22.49,
          "en": "And also, didn't mention before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.49,
          "end": 26.007,
          "en": "but we'll need it as well, also a BaseBadge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 29.23,
          "en": "which will basically render a badge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.23,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "For example, the areas of expertise here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 34.6,
          "en": "there I wanna use that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.6,
          "end": 36.323,
          "en": "But let's start with the BaseCard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.78,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "That will be a very simple component, in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 42.423,
          "en": "The template is just a div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.33,
          "end": 46.99,
          "en": "and then a slot inside of the div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.99,
          "end": 49.98,
          "en": "because I want to use this card as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.98,
          "end": 52.393,
          "en": "around any content you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.9,
          "end": 56.153,
          "en": "Now, I'll give this a class of card,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.98,
          "end": 60.513,
          "en": "and then add some scoped CSS code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.32,
          "en": "And attached, you find a base card CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.32,
          "end": 67.85,
          "en": "which holds the styles you should paste in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.85,
          "end": 70.4,
          "en": "This will give us this classic card look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.4,
          "end": 72.953,
          "en": "and also restrict the width we're taking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.78,
          "end": 76.563,
          "en": "And that's already it for the card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.62,
          "end": 81.35,
          "en": "Now we can use that card by registering it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.35,
          "end": 83.95,
          "en": "in main.js as a global component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.95,
          "end": 86.77,
          "en": "because I'm using it in many different areas of the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.77,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "hence, I wanna use it as a global component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 92.075,
          "en": "So in main.js I'll import BaseCard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.075,
          "end": 97.023,
          "en": "from ./components/uiBaseCard.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.14,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "and then here use my app to call the component method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 105.82,
          "en": "and register a base-card component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.82,
          "end": 109.193,
          "en": "which points at this BaseCard component we're importing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.13,
          "end": 114.563,
          "en": "And now we can use it in CoachesList, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.53,
          "end": 120.07,
          "en": "to wrap everything in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.07,
          "end": 123.56,
          "en": "so this controls div and the unordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.56,
          "end": 127.95,
          "en": "So here I'll use base-card, my opening tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.95,
          "end": 131.683,
          "en": "and then close it after this h3 tag here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.46,
          "end": 135.16,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.16,
          "end": 138.163,
          "en": "this looks much nicer already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.57999999999998,
          "end": 141.25,
          "en": "But now we got all these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.25,
          "end": 142.659,
          "en": "And, actually, these here, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.659,
          "end": 145.41,
          "en": "are links and not buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.41,
          "end": 148.06,
          "en": "but I would argue they should look like buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.06,
          "end": 151.1,
          "en": "because, whilst they technically are links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.1,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "well, in this UI,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 155.13,
          "en": "having them look like a button makes more sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.13,
          "end": 157.39,
          "en": "And, of course, we also got a button here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.39,
          "end": 159.52,
          "en": "which should look like a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.52,
          "end": 162.25,
          "en": "So I wanna build a BaseButton component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.25,
          "end": 166.403,
          "en": "which supports both real buttons and links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.35,
          "end": 169.03,
          "en": "And we can build something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.03,
          "end": 170.57,
          "en": "and apply the same styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.57,
          "end": 172.867,
          "en": "no matter whether it's a link or a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.867,
          "end": 175.867,
          "en": "And we're going to do this in the BaseButton component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.94,
          "end": 178.53,
          "en": "Here, we need a template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.53,
          "end": 181.77,
          "en": "And in that template, of course, we also have a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.77,
          "end": 185.313,
          "en": "the regular HTML button, which takes a slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.3,
          "end": 188.55,
          "en": "But it will not just have the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.55,
          "end": 190.46,
          "en": "we also wanna support links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.46,
          "end": 194.43,
          "en": "So I will actually also add router-link here as a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.43,
          "end": 196.313,
          "en": "which takes a slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.24,
          "end": 199.92000000000002,
          "en": "But, of course, only one of the two should be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.92000000000002,
          "end": 201.003,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.85,
          "end": 205.29,
          "en": "So, therefore, I will add a script",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 207.24,
          "en": "and accept some props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.24,
          "end": 209.48,
          "en": "And here I'll actually use the object form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.48,
          "end": 210.7,
          "en": "of the finding the props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.7,
          "end": 213.11,
          "en": "simply to also practice this again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.11,
          "end": 215.85,
          "en": "Most of the time, I used just the array form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.85,
          "end": 217.22,
          "en": "because it's shorter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.22,
          "end": 219.1,
          "en": "but using that object form, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.1,
          "end": 222.49,
          "en": "allows you to be more explicit about your props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.49,
          "end": 224.143,
          "en": "So which props do I need here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 225.06,
          "end": 228.07999999999998,
          "en": "I want to have a link prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 228.07999999999998,
          "end": 230.44,
          "en": "The link prop should signal to us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.44,
          "end": 232.63,
          "en": "whether we wanna render a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.63,
          "end": 234.61,
          "en": "or if link is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.61,
          "end": 236.363,
          "en": "if we want to render a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237.55,
          "end": 242.1,
          "en": "So, therefore, here I will set the type here to Boolean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.1,
          "end": 245.34,
          "en": "because I expect to get a Boolean here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.34,
          "end": 248.6,
          "en": "Set it to not required. It's optional.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.6,
          "end": 250.29,
          "en": "You don't have to specify it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.29,
          "end": 253.27,
          "en": "And set the default value to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.27,
          "end": 256.76,
          "en": "So, by default, we don't render a link but a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.76,
          "end": 259.48,
          "en": "And we can use the link prop now here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 259.48,
          "end": 264.05,
          "en": "to use or to render the button if not link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.05,
          "end": 265.93,
          "en": "hence the exclamation mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.93,
          "end": 269.77,
          "en": "and render the link, the router link, in the else case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.77,
          "end": 271.323,
          "en": "if link should be true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.24,
          "end": 275.81,
          "en": "This allows us to switch from outside the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 275.81,
          "end": 278.073,
          "en": "between a button and a router link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.15999999999997,
          "end": 281.74,
          "en": "I also want a to prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.74,
          "end": 283.96,
          "en": "which I need if a link is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.96,
          "end": 286.15999999999997,
          "en": "This will get a string value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 286.15999999999997,
          "end": 289.233,
          "en": "And here I want to set this to not required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.33,
          "end": 294.97,
          "en": "but set the default value to /, nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.97,
          "end": 299.97,
          "en": "The to prop is a useful prop if we do render a router link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 300.12,
          "end": 301.6,
          "en": "because in that case, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 301.6,
          "end": 305.37,
          "en": "I wanna bind to on the router link to my own to prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 305.37,
          "end": 306.57,
          "en": "which I just defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 309.133,
          "en": "so that we know where this link should go to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 310.24,
          "end": 313.23,
          "en": "And then there's one last prop which I wanna support,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 313.23,
          "end": 315.57,
          "en": "and that's the mode prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 315.57,
          "end": 318.98,
          "en": "This is a prop that allows us to control the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.98,
          "end": 321.87,
          "en": "the look of this button from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.87,
          "end": 324.92,
          "en": "Here, I simply want to get a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.92,
          "end": 327.94,
          "en": "and this is also not required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.94,
          "end": 330.41,
          "en": "The default, then, is just an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.41,
          "end": 332.58,
          "en": "or null, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.58,
          "end": 336.873,
          "en": "and I will use mode as a class on the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 338.47,
          "end": 340.46,
          "en": "That, of course, would theoretically allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 340.46,
          "end": 343.51,
          "en": "to pass anything as a class that will be added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 343.51,
          "end": 346.67,
          "en": "but I will only support a couple of specific classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 346.67,
          "end": 349.233,
          "en": "in the CSS code which we're soon going to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 350.5,
          "end": 353.61,
          "en": "So now we add class mode on both the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 353.61,
          "end": 355.26,
          "en": "and the router link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 355.26,
          "end": 358.17,
          "en": "And now it's time for styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 358.17,
          "end": 362.01,
          "en": "So let's add some scoped CSS styling down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 362.01,
          "end": 364.85,
          "en": "and attached you find a button CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 364.85,
          "end": 367.203,
          "en": "with all the button styles in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 368.33,
          "end": 371.04,
          "en": "And here I set up a base styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 371.04,
          "end": 374.43,
          "en": "and I'm always targeting button and anchor tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 374.43,
          "end": 377.34,
          "en": "because the router link will render an anchor tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 377.34,
          "end": 378.94,
          "en": "in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378.94,
          "end": 382.23,
          "en": "And then here the hover and active styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 382.23,
          "end": 385.91,
          "en": "and also the flat and outline styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 385.91,
          "end": 388.56,
          "en": "And these are the two modes which I support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 388.56,
          "end": 390.78,
          "en": "because here I'm selecting the flat class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 390.78,
          "end": 392.37,
          "en": "and the outline class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 392.37,
          "end": 394.29,
          "en": "so these styles will kick in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 394.29,
          "end": 398,
          "en": "if a flat or outline class is added to the button or link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 398,
